+// The libprotobuf-cpp-*-vendorcompat modules that used to live here are
+// defined by hardware/lineage/compat, which builds them with both the 32-bit
+// and 64-bit targets (and the 16 KB arm64 21.12 variant this device needs).
+// Defining them in both places makes soong abort with
+// "module prebuilt_libprotobuf-... already defined".
